&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt;（個　別）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 36px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 600px"&gt;
